# Copy to `.env` for local development. Vite only exposes VITE_-prefixed vars.

# Where breakdown reports are delivered.
#
# Get the key at https://web3forms.com — enter the inbox the reports should
# arrive in, confirm the address, and paste the key it mails you here. Then add
# the same value as a repository secret named WEB3FORMS_KEY (Settings →
# Secrets and variables → Actions) so the deployed build picks it up.
#
# This key is PUBLIC: it ships in the client bundle, as it must for a static
# site, and can only ever cause mail to be sent to the address it was issued
# for. The env var exists so the destination can change without a code edit.
#
# Leave it unset and the form falls back to composing the report in the
# visitor's own mail client — it never silently discards a report.
VITE_WEB3FORMS_KEY=
